{"key":"df1b29ba1e27b011733367f071d998dab8d3dd854b8151dfc4baafced3d4f6e7#1","quote":"Do not use headings, tables or long lists on WhatsApp.","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":880,"output":9}}
{"key":"6985bed88337e817df9e00973394e860db933c463394b1238c0c4c7a2f439c0f#1","quote":"If a guest sends a photo of a problem in a room, say you have passed it on and pass it on.","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":900,"output":9}}
