{"key":"8cb9227a82fceffd22756d3679eca290cc6f1fb7bbc23c41d7c5cab1daf02406#1","quote":"When the guest wants to book, ask for the name, dates and number of guests before anything else.","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":864,"output":9}}
